ipv6-parse provides CMake targets:

  find_package(ipv6-parse CONFIG REQUIRED)
  target_link_libraries(main PRIVATE ipv6-parse::ipv6-parse)

ipv6-parse also provides pkg-config:

  pkg_check_modules(IPV6_PARSE REQUIRED IMPORTED_TARGET ipv6-parse)
  target_link_libraries(main PRIVATE PkgConfig::IPV6_PARSE)

Command-line tool:

  ipv6-parse-cli "2001:db8::1/64"
  ipv6-parse-cli "[::1]:8080"
  ipv6-parse-cli "fe80::1%eth0"

For more information, see:
  https://github.com/jrepp/ipv6-parse
